### BuildCorp API · pruebas manuales (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
# Cambia @base para probar contra API Gateway:
#   @base = https://f5nr8vmiu8.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/api/v1
# Usuarios demo (cargar_demo): admin, bodeguero, encargado, ventas.
# La clave demo NO se escribe aquí: defínela como variable de entorno del cliente
# ({{$processEnv BUILDCORP_CLAVE}}) o reemplázala solo en tu copia local.

@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@clave = {{$processEnv BUILDCORP_CLAVE}}

### 1. Login (JWT) -> 200 {access, refresh}
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "{{clave}}"}

###
@access = {{login.response.body.access}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refresh}}

### 2. Usuario actual -> 200 {id, username, nombre, rol}
GET {{base}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 3. Refresh -> 200 con access y refresh nuevos (el refresh anterior queda en lista negra)
# @name renovar
POST {{base}}/auth/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh": "{{refresh}}"}

### 4. 401: sin token
GET {{base}}/contratistas/

### 5. 401: token inválido
GET {{base}}/contratistas/
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

### 6. GET lista paginada (filtro y búsqueda)
GET {{base}}/contratistas/?search=andes
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 7. POST -> 201
# @name nuevo
POST {{base}}/contratistas/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rut": "11.111.111-1", "razon_social": "Prueba API SpA", "contacto": "Ana Pérez"}

###
@id = {{nuevo.response.body.id}}

### 8. POST con RUT inválido -> 400 {"rut": ["El dígito verificador del RUT no es válido."]}
POST {{base}}/contratistas/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rut": "11.111.111-2", "razon_social": "X"}

### 9. PUT (reemplazo completo) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/contratistas/{{id}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rut": "11.111.111-1", "razon_social": "Prueba API Ltda.", "contacto": "Ana Pérez"}

### 10. PATCH (parcial) -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/contratistas/{{id}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"telefono": "+56 9 1111 1111"}

### 11. DELETE -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/contratistas/{{id}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 12. Subir foto de un activo (multipart) -> 200 con foto_url (prefirmada si USE_S3=True)
PATCH {{base}}/activos/31/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=limite

--limite
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="foto"; filename="foto.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./foto.png
--limite--

### 13. 403: rol Ventas intenta borrar un activo
# @name loginVentas
POST {{base}}/auth/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ventas", "password": "{{clave}}"}

###
DELETE {{base}}/activos/31/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVentas.response.body.access}}

### 14. Dashboard -> 200
GET {{base}}/dashboard/resumen/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 15. Logout (refresh a la lista negra) -> 200; luego usar ese refresh da 401
POST {{base}}/auth/logout/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh": "{{renovar.response.body.refresh}}"}
